flowchart TB
accTitle: Durable processing and mobile delivery solve different problems
accDescr: Location updates enter a durable queue, workers query a geographic index, and SNS uses platform push services instead of a persistent app connection.
M["Mobile location update"] --> A["Authenticated API"] --> Q[("SQS: retain accepted work")]
Q --> W["Scaled lookup workers"]
W --> D[("DynamoDB geographic-cell index")]
D --> W
W --> N["SNS mobile endpoint"]
N --> P["APNs / FCM"] --> O["Device OS notification"]
Q -.-> T["Queue age: scale before delay grows"]
T -.-> W
